WEBVTT

00:15.948 --> 00:18.948
This is the chaotic time of
spontaneous gangs.

00:19.657 --> 00:20.823
In order to scramble for territory...

00:21.612 --> 00:23.236
they are not afraid
to purge each other...

00:23.237 --> 00:24.237
despite the rules.

00:26.571 --> 00:27.071
Butcher...

00:28.529 --> 00:29.029
slaughter...

00:30.862 --> 00:31.946
to survive.

00:33.904 --> 00:35.612
Until the formation of four forces.

00:38.196 --> 00:40.487
These four hold hundreds of juniors
under their command...

00:40.696 --> 00:42.987
creating a balance in the underworld
during the time.

00:45.029 --> 00:46.821
They are known as:

00:47.487 --> 00:47.946
Cuong...

00:49.154 --> 00:50.404
Area: Cho Lon - Weapon: Chopper
Business: Protection, loaning.

00:50.446 --> 00:51.154
Hao...

00:51.179 --> 00:53.987
Area: Float Market - Weapon: Scimitar
Business: Protection, smuggling.

00:54.279 --> 00:54.779
Chan...

00:54.804 --> 00:57.154
Area: Cau Muoi Market - Weapon: Ice saw
Business: Protection, restaurants.

00:57.237 --> 00:57.803
Hung.

00:57.828 --> 00:59.904
Area: Night Market - Weapon: Pig chopper
knife Business: Smuggling, prostitute.

01:21.293 --> 01:22.376
Same as previous.

01:26.626 --> 01:27.834
May I buy you a drink?

01:37.668 --> 01:39.084
Don't you know who I am?

01:50.334 --> 01:50.876
Fuck off!

01:51.876 --> 01:52.751
You dumb bitch…

01:59.168 --> 01:59.709
Bro Long?

02:02.376 --> 02:02.918
I'm sorry...

02:03.313 --> 02:04.222
I didn't know she's yours.

02:07.334 --> 02:12.625
4 - WHEN THE DRAGON AWAKES

02:12.626 --> 02:13.584
Are you okay?

02:15.126 --> 02:16.168
Tang Sanzang!

02:21.709 --> 02:23.584
Why are you always drunk whenever we meet?

02:25.844 --> 02:26.761
It's fun being drunk!

02:28.003 --> 02:28.636
You're crazy.

02:29.196 --> 02:29.972
Where's the fun in that?

02:32.626 --> 02:33.660
Let's go out for another drink!

02:34.668 --> 02:35.543
Why not here?

02:36.584 --> 02:37.543
It's getting boring here.

02:38.253 --> 02:38.862
Let's go!

02:39.126 --> 02:40.668
- Just go!
- Where?

02:40.834 --> 02:41.751
- Go!
- Hey, wait…

03:02.582 --> 03:03.501
It's not a love affair.

03:05.084 --> 03:08.251
I'd rather be hit by one man
than being hit by anyone.

03:17.876 --> 03:19.209
Are you gonna do this
for the rest of your life?

03:22.043 --> 03:23.418
Is there any other way, ponyboy?

03:30.501 --> 03:31.459
My life depends on men.

03:59.584 --> 04:00.769
Aren't you afraid of Hac Hung?

04:11.834 --> 04:13.043
How long have you been following him?

04:16.834 --> 04:18.488
Are you trying to investigate or something?

04:21.293 --> 04:22.308
Just examining due to curiosity.

04:25.334 --> 04:26.626
Then why didn't you "examine" last time?

05:59.126 --> 06:01.834
It was delicious eating
Tang Sanzang last night!

06:02.084 --> 06:03.709
So I decided to treat you to a meal today.

06:12.459 --> 06:13.418
Why don't you eat?

06:13.959 --> 06:16.209
Are you afraid of being poisoned
by a demoness?

06:22.709 --> 06:23.668
You don't like it?

06:24.043 --> 06:25.001
I wanna eat something else.

06:39.334 --> 06:40.334
You're coming to Hac Hung's place again?

06:43.209 --> 06:43.751
Yeah.

06:47.251 --> 06:48.218
Is it possible
that you don't come to his place?

06:53.576 --> 06:55.192
Are you supporting my living if I don't go?

07:02.876 --> 07:03.526
Yes.

07:06.006 --> 07:06.932
I'll support your living.

07:17.626 --> 07:20.583
Take care of your living first,
and stop watching movies.

08:39.168 --> 08:39.793
Hanh!

08:39.918 --> 08:40.751
What happened?

08:43.376 --> 08:44.251
Sit. Let me see.

08:45.043 --> 08:46.584
Was it hurt when you fought them?

08:57.334 --> 08:58.668
It's still work hour.

09:11.126 --> 09:11.751
Hanh...

09:12.584 --> 09:14.376
what if I quit being a gangster?

09:16.293 --> 09:17.668
Then it would be great, of course.

09:18.584 --> 09:19.319
Really?

09:20.959 --> 09:21.793
Then…

09:38.668 --> 09:39.326
Then what?

09:43.959 --> 09:44.584
Hanh!

09:45.751 --> 09:46.251
Yes?

09:48.168 --> 09:49.162
Isn't the flower pretty?

09:50.376 --> 09:51.194
Are you daft?

09:56.168 --> 09:57.251
Any other requests?

09:58.751 --> 10:00.043
Do you still feel discomfort anywhere?

10:00.293 --> 10:01.293
If not, then go home.
I still have works to do.

10:01.341 --> 10:04.170
Go, quick, go now.

10:04.459 --> 10:05.186
I still have something…

10:06.376 --> 10:07.001
What is it?

10:08.334 --> 10:09.043
Isn't the flower pretty?

10:09.251 --> 10:12.459
I get that! Go home! Hurry!

10:18.168 --> 10:19.334
It's been a month, Chan!

10:19.626 --> 10:20.876
Do you have any idea how much money
I've lost in a month?

10:23.501 --> 10:25.251
Being impatient doesn't help.

10:26.418 --> 10:27.168
Slow but sure.

10:28.668 --> 10:31.043
You might not need money, but I do!

10:32.834 --> 10:33.873
It's drug dealing.

10:34.662 --> 10:36.811
We would rot in jail if we weren't careful.

10:37.543 --> 10:38.514
But what about our juniors?

10:38.751 --> 10:40.084
They need money, either!

10:42.245 --> 10:43.302
I'm not like you.

10:44.793 --> 10:46.584
You use money to bribe them...

10:46.959 --> 10:49.668
and I depend on them to make money.

10:49.876 --> 10:51.001
Shut the fuck up.

10:54.376 --> 10:56.959
Didn't you still join us
to assassinate Hai Cuong?

10:57.709 --> 10:58.834
Stop being a hypocrite!

11:01.709 --> 11:03.209
Hey, you two.

11:07.959 --> 11:08.751
Calm down.

11:10.793 --> 11:12.376
Keep waiting patiently for one more month.

12:26.668 --> 12:27.116
Ba!

12:28.751 --> 12:29.600
This is for you!

12:31.113 --> 12:33.029
And this one. We'll taste it later.

12:35.459 --> 12:35.793
Wow!

12:38.959 --> 12:39.751
Here's your advance.

12:40.168 --> 12:41.959
The rest would be given later.

12:42.233 --> 12:43.459
Gosh, did you hit the jackpot?

12:43.709 --> 12:44.584
I suppose so.

12:45.793 --> 12:46.561
How is your place?

12:47.584 --> 12:48.501
I haven't seen anything.

12:52.543 --> 12:53.834
I've guarded there for a month...

12:54.168 --> 12:55.168
but I didn't see him coming back.

12:55.543 --> 12:56.876
You act as if there is only one place!

12:57.918 --> 12:58.709
Oh, right.

13:00.543 --> 13:03.168
Hey! Why do you look so swanky today?

13:04.168 --> 13:05.876
Just dressing up a little bit
to attract some chicks.

13:06.959 --> 13:08.793
Hey, don't involve too much
with those women.

13:10.120 --> 13:13.536
Hell no! Are you kidding?
I'm not the one I used to be!

13:13.751 --> 13:14.334
Hey, Hung!

13:38.084 --> 13:39.084
Where did you get this?

13:42.043 --> 13:42.668
Dung gave me.

13:44.418 --> 13:44.793
Long!

13:46.001 --> 13:46.709
How much is it?

13:47.168 --> 13:47.709
Who knows?

13:52.918 --> 13:54.959
I'm confident the Night Market gang
is secretly dealing drugs.

13:57.043 --> 13:58.376
You know that girl.

13:59.626 --> 14:01.043
Don't let yourself become the second Phong.

14:02.001 --> 14:03.001
What the hell?

14:03.584 --> 14:04.334
Don't worry.

14:12.251 --> 14:12.876
Ba!

14:14.376 --> 14:14.918
You wanna die?

14:15.543 --> 14:17.292
- Spit it out!
- Holy crap, you'll be doggone, Ba!

14:17.293 --> 14:18.667
What… What's going on?

14:18.668 --> 14:19.501
Lift him!

14:19.584 --> 14:20.418
- What… What's going on?
- Spit it out!

14:20.418 --> 14:21.001
What the hell are you doing?

14:21.043 --> 14:22.209
Holy crap, you'll be doggone, Ba!

14:22.376 --> 14:23.293
- Lift him!
- What's happening?

14:24.543 --> 14:25.459
What the hell are you doing?

14:25.669 --> 14:27.836
Hey, get some water!

14:28.209 --> 14:29.334
Spit it out!

14:29.668 --> 14:30.605
Where's the water?

14:30.751 --> 14:32.168
- Get him some water!
- What's happening?

14:32.418 --> 14:33.668
That's wine, you nuts!

14:34.293 --> 14:35.458
- My God!
- What's happening?

14:35.459 --> 14:36.001
Stick your fingers down his throat!

14:58.816 --> 15:01.207
It was drugs, not wheat flour!
How could you consume that much?

15:04.876 --> 15:06.834
Long, you're growing wings like me.

15:09.376 --> 15:10.378
I'm flying…

15:11.675 --> 15:13.011
I'll get you something to eat.

15:13.376 --> 15:14.183
Stay there.

15:41.293 --> 15:43.168
Holy crap! He hasn't landed yet?

15:45.446 --> 15:46.097
Ba!

15:55.021 --> 15:58.188
- Ut Det! I'm coming to you…
- He's still getting stoned?

15:59.126 --> 15:59.793
Okay…

16:01.251 --> 16:01.918
Keep swimming…

16:02.626 --> 16:04.209
Here. It's the best one in District 10.

16:04.668 --> 16:05.334
Eat while it's hot.

16:05.501 --> 16:06.001
I'm taking a shower.

16:36.543 --> 16:37.355
What took you so long?

16:39.209 --> 16:40.386
I need to be careful.

16:49.238 --> 16:50.034
Are you playing with me?

16:53.310 --> 16:54.190
How could it be…?

16:58.043 --> 16:59.459
Are you looking for this, Phong?

17:03.894 --> 17:04.558
You son of a bitch!

17:09.543 --> 17:10.459
Have you lost your mind?

17:35.793 --> 17:38.209
Your life is in this shit!
It's in this shit!

17:39.668 --> 17:40.668
Don't you know how to think?

17:43.001 --> 17:44.251
Why are you always causing trouble?

17:45.251 --> 17:46.876
Do you wanna push us into a dead end?

17:56.959 --> 17:58.168
I know what you guys are thinking.

18:03.251 --> 18:03.793
You...

18:05.084 --> 18:06.626
you wanna make money
to take care of your parents?

18:08.126 --> 18:09.793
Or do you wait until they die
before you come home?

18:10.126 --> 18:10.589
You...

18:12.126 --> 18:12.709
And you...

18:14.209 --> 18:15.584
you said you wanted to make money
to marry Ut Det?

18:16.789 --> 18:18.666
Or do you wait until
she marries another man?

18:19.706 --> 18:21.049
You should marry that damn duck!

18:22.709 --> 18:23.535
And you...

18:25.011 --> 18:26.175
I bet you're hiding something.

18:32.380 --> 18:33.651
Who said we would bail
after making enough money?

18:34.918 --> 18:35.584
Is it enough?

18:36.626 --> 18:37.363
Is it?

18:38.012 --> 18:39.887
I just want to accelerate the progress.

18:43.107 --> 18:44.628
I don't fucking need this damn shirt!

18:44.988 --> 18:46.886
I don't wanna lose a friend
because of this!

18:52.355 --> 18:53.003
Phong!

18:55.709 --> 18:57.084
It's not too late to quit now.

18:58.334 --> 18:59.543
Listen to them!

19:05.043 --> 19:06.480
Fuck you all!

19:09.668 --> 19:11.334
I only have one life.

19:13.876 --> 19:15.959
I don't wanna live
in the shadow like a dog.

19:19.418 --> 19:21.126
I gotta control my own fate.

19:21.959 --> 19:23.543
I gotta take care of my mom.

19:27.668 --> 19:28.376
You bastard!

19:29.501 --> 19:30.751
Stop! You're out of your mind!

19:31.709 --> 19:32.668
Fuck you!

19:32.876 --> 19:33.834
Get off me!

19:34.043 --> 19:34.584
Get out!

19:37.959 --> 19:38.751
Fuck!

20:18.668 --> 20:20.834
Hey, are you sure it's here?

20:21.668 --> 20:23.418
Yes, I've guarded here for a month.

20:48.709 --> 20:49.668
Are you selling well these days?

20:49.876 --> 20:50.293
Good.

20:51.043 --> 20:51.834
Here are some more.

21:06.501 --> 21:07.751
Do know how tired it is to run after you?

21:09.793 --> 21:10.751
How long have you been selling drugs?

21:12.418 --> 21:13.668
I wanna go home.

21:14.293 --> 21:16.168
Say it again
and I'll smash this bottle on your head.

21:17.334 --> 21:19.001
It's because they forced me to do this.

21:19.376 --> 21:20.709
It wasn't my intention.

21:21.043 --> 21:24.418
But why didn't you catch them?
Why did you only catch me?

21:24.543 --> 21:25.084
Who forced you?

21:28.709 --> 21:29.084
Say it quick!

21:29.085 --> 21:31.334
I wouldn't be able to stop him
if he got mad and beat you.

21:36.043 --> 21:37.751
So the Night Market gang is dealing drugs.

21:42.376 --> 21:43.168
What about the other guy?

21:44.584 --> 21:45.501
Could you recognize him?

21:47.918 --> 21:48.584
He looked unfamiliar.

21:50.376 --> 21:51.918
That could be their new junior.

22:16.251 --> 22:17.334
Release this one.

22:22.459 --> 22:24.001
He was just being used.

22:25.251 --> 22:25.959
How do you know?

22:27.793 --> 22:29.543
This could be Chan's trap.

22:30.918 --> 22:32.043
You must be very careful.

22:36.209 --> 22:37.584
Have you collected any information...

22:38.168 --> 22:39.293
after the last negotiation?

22:43.834 --> 22:44.376
Ba!

22:45.084 --> 22:45.459
Yes!

22:45.543 --> 22:46.626
Release him!

22:49.626 --> 22:50.001
Go!

22:50.418 --> 22:52.168
Stop crying! Men don't weep.

23:00.459 --> 23:04.543
Oh my, you haven't called me for months.

23:04.834 --> 23:07.418
So, are you getting used to the new job?

23:08.084 --> 23:08.959
I'm good, mom.

23:09.668 --> 23:12.959
Listen, don't involved in any fights.

23:13.418 --> 23:15.793
You have to be patient to succeed.

23:15.876 --> 23:17.084
Okay, I know.

23:17.918 --> 23:21.459
But why did you send me money
so early this month?

23:22.251 --> 23:23.126
What money?

23:24.459 --> 23:27.001
Money for your father's treatment...

23:27.751 --> 23:29.293
Phong's mom's debt...

23:29.543 --> 23:32.168
and Ba's family.

23:33.584 --> 23:35.501
Oh! We received our payment
early this month.

23:39.293 --> 23:41.751
Mom, have you seen Phong coming home?

23:42.168 --> 23:45.876
What are you talking about?
Phong is not with you guys?

23:48.001 --> 23:48.876
No, nothing.

23:49.376 --> 23:50.876
I've got works to do now.

23:51.084 --> 23:52.126
I gotta hang up.

23:52.959 --> 23:53.334
Yes.

23:53.501 --> 23:54.918
Wait! Long!

24:02.834 --> 24:04.876
He still managed to send money back home.

24:07.751 --> 24:08.043
Ba!

24:08.543 --> 24:08.834
Huh?

24:09.168 --> 24:10.168
How about you come home for a while?

24:12.501 --> 24:14.083
Consider this a chance
to check on everyone back there...

24:14.084 --> 24:15.709
and you can also visit Ut Det.

24:16.543 --> 24:17.126
That makes sense.

25:15.626 --> 25:17.334
Have you just gone out
for a midnight snack, Hien?

25:23.168 --> 25:25.918
Oh, or should I say…

25:26.376 --> 25:29.543
you've just gone to the Night Market.

25:31.751 --> 25:32.668
What do you mean?

25:33.084 --> 25:33.918
You went to the Night Market...

25:34.543 --> 25:35.459
to meet the Float Market gang...

25:36.126 --> 25:37.209
and went back to Cho Lon.

25:37.959 --> 25:39.043
What do you mean?

25:40.001 --> 25:40.626
What are you saying?

25:40.709 --> 25:41.543
Take him!

25:43.543 --> 25:44.876
Long, are you crazy?

25:46.126 --> 25:46.709
Crazy?

25:48.668 --> 25:49.334
Who's crazy?

25:50.709 --> 25:52.084
Who's crazy?

25:53.209 --> 25:54.501
It's not what you think.

25:55.668 --> 25:56.376
Get off me!

25:56.751 --> 25:57.251
Get off!

25:57.709 --> 26:01.709
So this is
how you've been negotiating, huh?

26:02.793 --> 26:04.168
Impound this rat!

26:05.959 --> 26:06.418
Quick!

26:40.918 --> 26:41.918
Did he hit you again?

26:44.626 --> 26:46.501
After getting this done,
will you come with me?

26:49.084 --> 26:50.001
When will this be done?

26:50.876 --> 26:52.459
And if we run, then where do we run?

26:59.668 --> 27:02.126
I have investigated what you asked me to.

27:03.501 --> 27:05.251
Phong is at Cau Muoi Market.

27:07.876 --> 27:08.876
I thought he was at Night Market?

27:09.751 --> 27:11.668
I heard Chan was trying to recruit him.

27:12.126 --> 27:14.376
Otherwise, he would be dead
if Hac Hung caught him.

27:18.251 --> 27:20.418
That's all I know for now.

27:21.209 --> 27:23.626
I'll tell you more as soon
as I have new information.

27:37.001 --> 27:38.168
I have to go now.

27:55.376 --> 27:56.043
Honey!

27:57.293 --> 27:58.459
I have a gift for you.

28:16.084 --> 28:16.584
Is it true?

28:28.334 --> 28:31.876
Babe, can we just leave now?

28:36.876 --> 28:37.459
Just count on me.

28:38.168 --> 28:38.834
After getting this done...

28:39.418 --> 28:41.001
I will take you back home
to meet my parents.

28:45.126 --> 28:46.168
But I'm worried…

28:49.668 --> 28:50.543
Don't worry.

28:51.709 --> 28:53.334
I'm sure my parents are gonna love you.

29:19.001 --> 29:21.084
[YOUR FRIEND IS AT MY PLACE.
COME PICK HIM UP]

29:50.043 --> 29:50.834
Release my friend!

30:25.501 --> 30:26.168
Can we go now?

30:37.626 --> 30:38.543
Your friend...

30:40.501 --> 30:41.668
he ruined my property.

30:42.418 --> 30:43.251
And you...

30:45.334 --> 30:46.709
you banged my property.

30:48.418 --> 30:49.334
My motto is...

30:50.584 --> 30:52.334
anything that I no longer touch...

30:57.709 --> 30:58.459
will be demolished!

31:29.418 --> 31:31.168
Son of a bitch!
What have you done to Dung?

33:43.918 --> 33:45.543
Long!

34:46.001 --> 34:47.584
I don't regret being born
in this life to meet you guys!

35:04.418 --> 35:04.918
Long!

35:05.834 --> 35:06.334
Long!

35:08.584 --> 35:09.084
Long!

35:09.543 --> 35:10.668
I'm fine.

35:11.293 --> 35:12.168
Big Brother is in trouble.

35:13.084 --> 35:14.126
Call Hung.

35:45.793 --> 35:47.251
Phong!
